2026-09-27 K12b: isolated cases, original object/module and changed gate PASS.

RED: bitmap-constant-memory.c reaches E3039 at bitmap_constant_required in
both interpreters and leaves an undefined native symbol. The separate
bitmap-constant-selection.c repeats the failure through constant-query
dispatch between nonvolatile and volatile reads. Both RED tests compile;
these are failed value/knowledge assertions, not Rust compilation errors.

GREEN: the shared C-HIR substitution path tracks bounded, typed cells of
fixed automatic integer objects/arrays by symbol and element offset. Definite
stores update one cell; unknown/overlapping writes, calls, volatile/atomic
accesses and unsupported control flow invalidate facts. Branches carry only
the selected facts or their intersection. Scope exits discard local identities;
cleanup invalidates the affected environment. No uninitialized bytes, record
padding, pointer bits, or arbitrary memory value is invented.

The original reads, writes and UB/access checks remain. Proved values are
used only after retained execution or for unevaluated optimization queries;
source ICE admission is unchanged. In particular a &= 0 can establish zero
after completion but still reports E3001 on an uninitialized source. Signed
overflow and out-of-bounds controls retain E3004/E3011 in both interpreters.
Known local-address/null relations do not expose a numerical address, and
truncating the address to 32 bits does not acquire a nonnull proof.

Unreachable inline returns previously overwrote the known reachable return.
Those statements/declarations remain (including attributes and symbol roles),
but their facts are visited in a separate context. A literal do/while(0)
without incoming labels or source jumps has one execution, not an unknown
loop iteration. This is general control-flow handling, not a bitmap whitelist.

81 query regressions pass, including alias/partial-byte writes, volatile reads,
unknown calls, conditional/short-circuit effects, early returns, cleanup,
loops, gotos, independent cells, narrow conversions and the negative checks.
Three permanent C fixtures pass GCC14/Clang19 at -O2 and -Os, and native EvoCC:
15 compile/link/execution controls, no assertion stub. Clang emits an ordinary
unused-expression warning for the boundary fixture; it still executes exit 0.

